    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citadel Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a kingdom marked by secrets and betrayals, you are the Knight of the Citadel, a lone warrior seeking the hidden truth beneath the shadows of the monarchy. The legend of a peaceful empire begins to crumble as you traverse forbidden forests, forgotten dungeons, and the mysterious Necropolis, where echoes of the past whisper tales of injustice and suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, the challenges grow deadlier: ancient creatures guard forbidden relics, while a usurper mage rules the Lost Palace of King Jeremias. To defeat him, you will need skill, strategy, and unwavering determination. But beware\u2014nothing is as it seems, and the answers you seek may be darker than you ever imagined...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Explore a kingdom full of mysteries</strong> \u2013 Uncover ruins, dungeons, and secrets buried by time.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Intense and strategic combat</strong> \u2013 Face brutal monsters and relentless warriors in challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.poster.avif?t=1754963427\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.webm?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.mp4?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Mystery and intrigue</strong> \u2013 Gather clues and relics to unveil the truth behind the empire\u2019s fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/16931a4963cd824223e52e9042fd955d.poster.avif?t=1754963427\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/16931a4963cd824223e52e9042fd955d.webm?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/16931a4963cd824223e52e9042fd955d.mp4?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Forge your destiny</strong> \u2013 Reach the Lost Palace and confront your ultimate challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/5b4f673e0532c0fa9c93fa8a990666bf.poster.avif?t=1754963427\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/5b4f673e0532c0fa9c93fa8a990666bf.webm?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/5b4f673e0532c0fa9c93fa8a990666bf.mp4?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the kingdom is in your hands. Will you become just another forgotten legend\u2026 or the hero who restores the Citadel\u2019s glory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citadel Knight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a kingdom marked by secrets and betrayals, you are the Knight of the Citadel, a lone warrior seeking the hidden truth beneath the shadows of the monarchy. The legend of a peaceful empire begins to crumble as you traverse forbidden forests, forgotten dungeons, and the mysterious Necropolis, where echoes of the past whisper tales of injustice and suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, the challenges grow deadlier: ancient creatures guard forbidden relics, while a usurper mage rules the Lost Palace of King Jeremias. To defeat him, you will need skill, strategy, and unwavering determination. But beware\u2014nothing is as it seems, and the answers you seek may be darker than you ever imagined...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Explore a kingdom full of mysteries</strong> \u2013 Uncover ruins, dungeons, and secrets buried by time.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Intense and strategic combat</strong> \u2013 Face brutal monsters and relentless warriors in challenging battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.poster.avif?t=1754963427\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.webm?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601640/extras/7065c6f32dac270b0683b80ebfaeb2eb.mp4?t=1754963427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Mystery and intrigue</strong> \u2013 Gather clues and relics to unveil the truth behind the empire\u2019s fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"